columnsTest label render within none
columnsTest label decode loopKind none
columnsTest label decode within none
columnsTest label compare loopKind none
columnsTest label compare within none
columnsTest label refused loopKind none
columnsTest label refused within none
columnsTest let source String "\"\xc3\xa9\" x" immutable
columnsTest let expected String "1:1 text \"\xc3\xa9\"\n1:5 identifier x\n1:6 endOfInput\n" immutable
columnsTest let refusedText String "the source was refused or could not be listed" immutable
columnsTest at begin do makeTokens
columnsTest at begin branch ifError makeTokens goto refused else goto render
columnsTest at render do newListing
columnsTest at render do writeTokens
columnsTest at render branch ifError writeTokens goto refused else goto decode
columnsTest at decode do readListing
columnsTest at decode branch ifError readListing goto refused else goto compare
columnsTest at compare do expectListing
columnsTest at compare return ok none
columnsTest at refused do failRefused
columnsTest at refused return ok none

