invalidByteTest is test
invalidByteTest purpose "A two-byte character outside quoted text on line 2 is refused at 2:3"
invalidByteTest verifies tokenize rejectsInvalidByte
invalidByteTest typeParameter none
invalidByteTest input none
invalidByteTest output none
invalidByteTest outputOwnedBy none
invalidByteTest raises none
invalidByteTest effect none
invalidByteTest uses none
invalidByteTest memoryHeap true
invalidByteTest async false
invalidByteTest maxRecursion none
invalidByteTest label begin loopKind none
invalidByteTest label begin within none
invalidByteTest label inspect loopKind none
invalidByteTest label inspect within none
invalidByteTest label rightVariant loopKind none
invalidByteTest label rightVariant within none
invalidByteTest label wrongVariant loopKind none
invalidByteTest label wrongVariant within none
invalidByteTest label accepted loopKind none
invalidByteTest label accepted within none
invalidByteTest let source String "ok\n  \xc3\xa9" immutable
invalidByteTest let expectedLine Int64 2 immutable
invalidByteTest let expectedColumn Int64 3 immutable
invalidByteTest let acceptedText String "the source was accepted" immutable
invalidByteTest let wrongText String "the source was refused for the wrong reason" immutable
invalidByteTest at begin do makeTokens
invalidByteTest at begin branch ifError makeTokens goto inspect else goto accepted
invalidByteTest at inspect match lexError LexError
invalidByteTest at inspect case LexError.invalidByte bind where string.Position goto rightVariant
invalidByteTest at inspect case LexError.unterminatedText bind unterminatedTextAt string.Position goto wrongVariant
invalidByteTest at inspect case LexError.integerTooLarge bind integerTooLargeAt string.Position goto wrongVariant
invalidByteTest at rightVariant do readLine
invalidByteTest at rightVariant do expectLine
invalidByteTest at rightVariant do readColumn
invalidByteTest at rightVariant do expectColumn
invalidByteTest at rightVariant return ok none
invalidByteTest at wrongVariant do failWrong
invalidByteTest at wrongVariant return ok none
invalidByteTest at accepted do failAccepted
invalidByteTest at accepted return ok none

