unterminatedTest is test
unterminatedTest purpose "Quoted text that a newline ends early is refused at its opening quote, 1:3"
unterminatedTest verifies tokenize rejectsUnterminatedText
unterminatedTest typeParameter none
unterminatedTest input none
unterminatedTest output none
unterminatedTest outputOwnedBy none
unterminatedTest raises none
unterminatedTest effect none
unterminatedTest uses none
unterminatedTest memoryHeap true
unterminatedTest async false
unterminatedTest maxRecursion none
unterminatedTest label begin loopKind none
unterminatedTest label begin within none
unterminatedTest label inspect loopKind none
unterminatedTest label inspect within none
unterminatedTest label rightVariant loopKind none
unterminatedTest label rightVariant within none
unterminatedTest label wrongVariant loopKind none
unterminatedTest label wrongVariant within none
unterminatedTest label accepted loopKind none
unterminatedTest label accepted within none
unterminatedTest let source String "x \"abc\n\"" immutable
unterminatedTest let expectedLine Int64 1 immutable
unterminatedTest let expectedColumn Int64 3 immutable
unterminatedTest let acceptedText String "the source was accepted" immutable
unterminatedTest let wrongText String "the source was refused for the wrong reason" immutable
unterminatedTest at begin do makeTokens
unterminatedTest at begin branch ifError makeTokens goto inspect else goto accepted
unterminatedTest at inspect match lexError LexError
unterminatedTest at inspect case LexError.invalidByte bind invalidByteAt string.Position goto wrongVariant
unterminatedTest at inspect case LexError.unterminatedText bind where string.Position goto rightVariant
unterminatedTest at inspect case LexError.integerTooLarge bind integerTooLargeAt string.Position goto wrongVariant
unterminatedTest at rightVariant do readLine
unterminatedTest at rightVariant do expectLine
unterminatedTest at rightVariant do readColumn
unterminatedTest at rightVariant do expectColumn
unterminatedTest at rightVariant return ok none
unterminatedTest at wrongVariant do failWrong
unterminatedTest at wrongVariant return ok none
unterminatedTest at accepted do failAccepted
unterminatedTest at accepted return ok none

