outsideTokenTest is test
outsideTokenTest purpose "An identifier token at offset 5 of the one-byte source x is refused with outOfRange 5"
outsideTokenTest verifies writeListing rejectsOutsideToken
outsideTokenTest typeParameter none
outsideTokenTest input none
outsideTokenTest output none
outsideTokenTest outputOwnedBy none
outsideTokenTest raises none
outsideTokenTest effect none
outsideTokenTest uses none
outsideTokenTest memoryHeap true
outsideTokenTest async false
outsideTokenTest maxRecursion none
outsideTokenTest label begin loopKind none
outsideTokenTest label begin within none
outsideTokenTest label inspect loopKind none
outsideTokenTest label inspect within none
outsideTokenTest label rightStart loopKind none
outsideTokenTest label rightStart within none
outsideTokenTest label accepted loopKind none
outsideTokenTest label accepted within none
outsideTokenTest let source String "x" immutable
outsideTokenTest let five Int64 5 immutable
outsideTokenTest let three Int64 3 immutable
outsideTokenTest let one Int64 1 immutable
outsideTokenTest let acceptedText String "a token outside the source was listed" immutable
outsideTokenTest at begin do makeTokens
outsideTokenTest at begin do makeKind
outsideTokenTest at begin do makeStart
outsideTokenTest at begin do makeToken
outsideTokenTest at begin do appendToken
outsideTokenTest at begin do newListing
outsideTokenTest at begin do writeTokens
outsideTokenTest at begin branch ifError writeTokens goto inspect else goto accepted
outsideTokenTest at inspect match listingError string.StringIndexError
outsideTokenTest at inspect case string.StringIndexError.outOfRange bind badStart Int64 goto rightStart
outsideTokenTest at rightStart do expectStart
outsideTokenTest at rightStart return ok none
outsideTokenTest at accepted do failAccepted
outsideTokenTest at accepted return ok none

